&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL CONTEXT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What if technology allowed us to push the boundaries and take sports experiences to new levels? That&#39;s exactly our goal at Decathlon Digital! We are a team of 5,000+ experts in software engineering, product management, data, cloud, and cybersecurity, distributed across Paris, Lille, and Amsterdam. Together, we are creating the largest digital sports platform, leveraging tech innovation from design to value chain optimization, connected experiences and product second life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changing the game for good&lt;/strong&gt;. We are in this for the love of sports. And like everything we love, we want it to last. That’s why we are embarking on a journey to create a more sustainable tech model, reducing our direct environmental impact while maintaining a safe, diverse, and inclusive space for all our people to learn and thrive together. Team up with us to design the digital future of sports.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Purpose of Position&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Product Team is looking for a passionate and dedicated colleague to join them and build world-class products to move the performance marketing industry forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will work closely with both internal and external developers to build plugins, connectors and other integrations including with e-commerce and customer data platforms. You will support the product backlog management and ensure that our products meet customer needs and business objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an exciting role where you will build and maintain a deep understanding of the e-commerce landscape and industry trends.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you care about delivering products that customers love, enjoy working with different cultures, and meeting people from around the world, this position is a great opportunity for you. Join our team at our Product Hubs in &lt;strong&gt;Berlin&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;London, Amsterdam or Milan, &lt;/strong&gt;or work from another country where Awin has an office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be responsible for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In this role, you will collaborate with product managers to manage the backlog.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will liaise between internal and external engineers, the UX team, and stakeholders to ensure clear communication of product requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will monitor product performance metrics and generate reports to support data-driven decision making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will partner with customer-facing teams to gather customer feedback and insights, and use that feedback to inform product development decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will identify opportunities with product peers to further add value to our plugins and various platform integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will work with the Product Marketing team to communicate releases and drive adoption of existing and new products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will develop and maintain a deep understanding of the e-commerce, customer-data platform landscape, and industry trends to inform product strategy for platform integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a bachelor’s degree in Business, Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field, or equivalent relevant work experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have first experience or curiosity about working in product development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience or high-level understanding of Ecommerce or similar platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable with web technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are data driven and possess analytical and problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable in communicating with multiple stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are self-motivated, organised, capable of prioritising work and focusing on important tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;RichTextList-bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexi-Week&lt;/strong&gt;: We prioritise your mental health and wellbeing by offering you a four-day Flexi-Week (with one lighter or completely disconnected day per week) at full pay, with no reduction to your annual holiday allowance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexi-office&lt;/strong&gt;: We offer an international culture and flexibility through our hybrid/remote working scheme which is designed to foster a culture of mutual trust and working flexibility.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Expense Contribution &amp;amp; Remote Working Furniture&lt;/strong&gt;: You will receive a monthly allowance to cover part of your running costs, as well as a furniture package to support you in setting up a comfortable workspace when working from home.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health and Wellbeing&lt;/strong&gt;: With our support and access to various initiatives and sports offers, you can focus on your mental and physical wellbeing.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Development&lt;/strong&gt;: We’ve built our extensive training suite, Awin Academy, to cover a wide range of skills that support your professional and personal growth, with trainings conveniently packaged to help your overall development.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Appreciation&lt;/strong&gt;: Thank and reward colleagues by sending them a voucher through our peer-to-peer recognition programme.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
