&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our mission&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;bub-content-body&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Constructor’s mission is to enable all educational organisations to provide high-quality digital education to 10x people with 10x efficiency.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With strong expertise in machine intelligence and data science, Constructor’s all-in-one platform for education and research addresses today’s pressing educational challenges: access inequality, tech clutter, and low engagement of students.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please send your resume in English only.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As the &lt;strong&gt;Senior Technical Product Manager for Platform&lt;/strong&gt;, you will own the product strategy for the shared services layer that powers Constructor&#39;s learning and research applications. You will drive the evolution of Platform capabilities - including identity, data infrastructure, AI/ML services, and developer tools - into a modular foundation. Your work enables internal teams and external partners to build and ship faster while maintaining enterprise-grade security, compliance, and global readiness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duties and Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and drive the product vision for a multi-instance, scalable foundation that supports SaaS and on-premise deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with application product teams to consolidate fragmented components and requirements into unified platform services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay up-to-date with industry developments and technologies to inform Platform strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate Platform insights and recommendations to stakeholders and the leadership team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a point of contact for cross-functional teams and stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse performance data to identify areas for improvement and optimisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the development team to identify and prioritise new features and capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive a roadmap with dependencies across the wider organisation, balancing technical constraints with business needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Qualifications and experience:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience working as a program or product manager for a platform, SaaS infrastructure, or API products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Computer Science or similar degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A strong technical background.&lt;/strong&gt; You are comfortable discussing API design, architecture, and authentication flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical and problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and collaboration skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading teams and working with cross-functional stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with developer platforms or platform-as-a-service products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing AI/ML infrastructure or platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;1027&quot;&gt;💻 Choice of work equipment (e.g., laptop, monitor, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;1027&quot;&gt;🇬🇧 English classes (iTalki – $130 monthly)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;1027&quot;&gt;⏰ Flexible schedule (we usually work between 09:00/10:00 and 18:00/19:00)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;1027&quot;&gt;👶 Newborn bonus (€500 per child)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;1027&quot;&gt;🧠 Patent remuneration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;1027&quot;&gt;🌴 Paid leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;1027&quot;&gt;🧑‍💻 Remote work in locations without our offices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;1027&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid work in locations with offices (2 days in-office, 3 days remote)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
