&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At AccountsIQ, part of the AIQ Group, we’re on a mission to deeply understand our customers and deliver technology that enriches their lives. Alongside ExpenseIn, a leading expense management platform within the group, we provide smart, feature-rich financial management software designed for ambitious businesses that have outgrown basic starter systems or seek a simpler, more affordable alternative to complex, costly ERP solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Our cloud-based accounting software transforms the finance function, making it easier for multi-entity businesses to capture, process, and report their financial data with ease and efficiency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Product Marketing Manager to take the foundations set out in our growth strategy, our product vision and our customer focus and drive a throughline across every team, every launch and every customer touchpoint. You&#39;ll report to our Product Director and work closely with marketing, sales, account management, implementation and customer success, so the whole business tells the same story to the right customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;It&#39;s a hands-on role that balances strategy, operations and execution. You’ll inform critical decisions, do the work yourself and build the systems that let it scale. You&#39;ll also be the voice of our product, inside the business and out. There&#39;s plenty of room for this role to grow as the function does.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Understand&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Know our best fit customers better than anyone. Deepen our understanding of who we serve best, our core segments and the people involved in buying and using our products. Feed that directly into product decisions, and make sure messaging and launches are built around it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Reset competitive intelligence. Build a clear view of the landscape that helps teams win against the systems customers are outgrowing and the alternatives they&#39;re weighing up.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Shape&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Develop the complete value proposition. Work with product and service leads so today&#39;s product, what&#39;s coming and the service experience (onboarding, implementation and customer success) all deliver on our positioning.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Shape how customers see what we offer. Help evolve how our products and services are structured, named and packaged, in step with the roadmap, so the offer is easy to understand, shows where it&#39;s heading and gives every launch an obvious place to fit.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Connect product value to commercial results. Understand how each release adds value for customers, and help us capture it in new business, expansion and retention. Measure the impact of launches and enablement on pipeline, win rates and adoption.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Deliver&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Lead the go-to-market rhythm. Run how product, marketing and customer-facing teams across our product family prepare for and deliver launches, so the right work happens at the right time and everyone knows where things stand.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Be the voice of our product. Speak at customer roadshows, events and webinars, and give our point of view on market shifts, such as what AI means for finance leaders in the UK and Ireland.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strengthen our core, open up what&#39;s next. Make our proven go-to-market motion sharper while building new ones for the new segments our product roadmap opens up. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Enable the whole business. Make sure every team, from sales and customer success to support and product, understands our customers, segments, competitors and positioning well enough to move their own work forward at pace. Clear enough to act on, deep enough to rely on.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Turn positioning into pipeline. Work hand in hand with demand generation on campaign messaging, ABM plays, paid copy and outbound sequences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Build a go-to-market system that stays current. Use AI and automation to keep customer and market insight flowing in, and keep messaging, battle cards, proof and customer stories up to date and easy to find.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Typically six or more years in B2B SaaS product marketing, including launches for a product bought through a considered, sales-led process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience being part of building or scaling a product marketing function, ideally in a scale-up.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Scale-up instincts. You know what breaks as a business outgrows its earlier stage habits, and how to fix it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Hands-on use of AI to run product marketing better: synthesising research, keeping content current, and building workflows that save the team time, with the judgement to know when the output is right.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Ownership of positioning and messaging, seen through to how the business sells, onboards and supports customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;A track record of running go-to-market across product, sales and customer success, leading through influence rather than authority.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Customer understanding you&#39;ve built first-hand: interviews, win/loss, segmentation and personas, and evidence it changed what a product team built.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Based in the UK or Ireland, with regular time in our London and Dublin offices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Desirable:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience in finance, accounting or fintech software, especially selling to finance leaders&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Marketing a multi-product suite, or bringing products and teams together&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Working with an offer where experience (implementation, onboarding, customer success) is part of the value&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s the hiring process?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;An initial call with our People Team to discuss your experience, career goals and interest in joining AccountsIQ.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;An interview with our Product Director and our Product Consultant to explore your product marketing experience, strategic approach and commercial impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;A short practical exercise presented to a panel from Product, Operations and Finance, focusing on your approach to positioning and bringing a product to market.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why work with us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;AIQ Group brings together AccountsIQ and ExpenseIn, two ambitious SaaS businesses helping finance teams work smarter. In 2026, AccountsIQ was recognised as SaaS Provider of the Year at the International Accounting Awards and ranked #477 in the Financial Times FT1000 list of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing companies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Following a €60M investment in 2024, we&#39;re continuing to grow our products, our people and our impact, making this an exciting time to join the business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Our TEAM values aren&#39;t just words on a wall; they shape how we work every day:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Together - We work towards shared goals, support one another and celebrate success as one team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Energy - We bring curiosity, positivity and urgency, focusing on what matters most for our customers and colleagues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Action - We take ownership, make decisions and deliver with purpose.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Mindset - We embrace feedback, think big and continually raise the bar for ourselves and each other.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If you&#39;re looking for a business that&#39;s growing quickly, values collaboration and gives people the opportunity to make a genuine impact, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Some of our perks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;28 days annual leave + bank holidays + your birthday off&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Working from abroad - up to 6 weeks per calendar year&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Private Health Insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;5% Pension contribution&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Life Assurance - 4 x Salary&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Income Benefit&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Wellbeing initiatives &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;By submitting your application, you agree that AccountsIQ Group may collect your personal data for recruiting, global organisation planning, and related purposes. AccountsIQ Group’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.accountsiq.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; explains what personal information we may process, where we may process your personal information, our purposes for processing your personal information, and the rights you can exercise over AccountsIQ Group’s use of your personal information.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;LTK’s mission is to empower the world’s premium lifestyle Creators to achieve maximum economic success. We have a huge opportunity ahead of us and we’re looking for team members who want to create, innovate and disrupt an industry.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We empower our team members to drive innovation, create value, and continue to spearhead the creation of this industry — a game changer when it comes to career growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Director, Brand Partnerships (UK)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; London, UK&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to:&lt;/strong&gt; VP, Brand Partnerships (EU)&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Full Time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Director, Brand Partnerships&lt;/strong&gt; to join our growing EU Brand Partnerships team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior commercial role responsible for driving enterprise growth across the UK through the acquisition, growth and strategic development of LTK&#39;s most valuable brand partnerships. You&#39;ll own the development of high-value relationships with leading fashion, beauty, lifestyle and luxury brands, positioning LTK as a trusted, long-term creator commerce partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As one of the UK&#39;s most senior commercial leaders, you&#39;ll lead consultative sales conversations with executive stakeholders, identifying opportunities to solve complex marketing challenges through LTK&#39;s full-funnel creator marketing solutions. You&#39;ll be responsible for building new enterprise relationships while strategically growing a portfolio of LTK Europe’s highest-potential and highest-value brand partners. Through a consultative approach, you&#39;ll develop a healthy pipeline of opportunities, convert new business and expand long-term investment across your accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with Brand Activation, Creator Success, Campaign Operations and Marketing, you&#39;ll own the long-term growth of strategic brand partners, taking over once brands have successfully onboarded and transitioned through their initial activation phase to maximise retention, investment and lifetime value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for an experienced enterprise seller who thrives on opening new opportunities, influencing senior decision-makers and building meaningful commercial partnerships across every level of a brand&#39;s marketing organisation—from executive leadership through to day-to-day marketing teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Own&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Sales &amp;amp; Market Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute the UK enterprise &amp;amp; mid market business strategy across fashion, beauty, lifestyle and luxury sectors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a healthy pipeline of high-value opportunities through strategic prospecting, networking and industry engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop relationships across senior marketing organisations, including CMOs, Marketing Directors, Digital, Social, Affiliate and Ecommerce leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex consultative sales cycles from discovery through negotiation and contract execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position LTK as a strategic creator commerce partner by delivering insight-led, value-based sales conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently exceed ambitious Managed Services and Advertising revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Account Growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and grow a portfolio of strategic brand partners, identifying opportunities to increase investment across LTK&#39;s commercial solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop long-term account strategies that deepen relationships and expand LTK&#39;s footprint across multiple business units.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities across creator collaborations, paid media, content, licensing, events and emerging commercial products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted executive relationships that position LTK as a long-term strategic marketing partner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver executive business reviews, strategic recommendations and commercial proposals that support long-term partnership growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with clients to solve evolving marketing challenges through innovative creator-led solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Brand Activation to ensure a seamless transition of newly activated brands into long-term commercial management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Marketing, Creator Success, Campaign Operations, Product and Operations to deliver an exceptional partner experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share market intelligence and customer feedback to influence product development, commercial strategy and go-to-market initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development of sales playbooks, enterprise outreach strategies and consultative selling best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify emerging categories, market trends and whitespace opportunities to expand LTK&#39;s enterprise footprint across the UK.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent LTK across the UK marketing industry by building executive-level relationships, speaking at key industry events and strengthening LTK&#39;s position as the leading creator commerce platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a senior commercial leader within the UK Brand Partnerships team, shaping commercial strategy, coach consultative selling and foster a culture of high performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently exceed individual sales quotas while contributing to wider UK Business Partnerships objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use performance data and commercial insights to continuously optimise sales strategy and pipeline health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate pipeline management, forecasting and reporting through HubSpot and internal systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build compelling, insight-led presentations and business cases tailored to executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of consumer trends, retail innovation and the evolving creator economy to identify new commercial opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years&#39; experience in enterprise sales, strategic partnerships or business development within digital marketing, media, SaaS or influencer marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of consistently exceeding commercial targets through enterprise new business acquisition and strategic account growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A consultative relationship builder who earns trust quickly and is comfortable influencing senior stakeholders through insight rather than transactional selling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading complex consultative sales cycles involving multiple stakeholders and executive decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional commercial acumen with the ability to translate market trends into compelling business opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding presentation, negotiation and executive communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of influencer marketing, affiliate marketing, social commerce and the evolving creator economy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable influencing cross-functional teams and collaborating across multiple business functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing senior relationships across fashion, beauty, luxury and lifestyle brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly strategic while remaining hands-on and execution focused.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, entrepreneurial and driven to build new commercial opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English language skills; additional European languages are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A mindset focused on seizing opportunities and moving with urgency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dedication to fierce prioritization and operational excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptability to a dynamic, fast-moving environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A growth mindset and openness to feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; color: #ffffff;&quot;&gt;#LI-AJ1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary, bonuses, and private pension scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Flexible work schedule plus Summer Fridays (workday ends at 3 pm)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;25 days holiday, plus an extra day for your birthday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A benefits and wellness scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Private medical care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Paid volunteering days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Professional development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Work anniversary celebrations, including extra annual holidays, and luxury gifting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Interesting problems to solve with an expert team at a rapid-growth retail disruptor and the largest creator marketing platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Happy Hours and team events and activities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About LTK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Founded in 2011, LTK is the global technology platform purpose-built to empower lifestyle creators to monetize their content. The full-service platform connects brands, creators, and shoppers with a world-class shopping app and trusted tools and technology that make content instantly shoppable. Today, premium lifestyle creators in 150+ countries drive more than $3.6 billion in annual retail sales through their LTK Shop profiles. More than 20 million consumers turn to LTK Shops in the LTK shopping platform each month to find inspiration and instantly shop the styles recommended by their favorite creators. And, more than 6,000 brands partner with LTK to gain access to its global creator network for content that converts against performance-driven, cross-channel KPIs. LTK is headquartered in Dallas, TX, and currently operates on five continents.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;To empower the world’s premium lifestyle Creators to achieve maximum economic success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Here to win&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Commit to the journey&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Work well&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commitment to Diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;LTK believes diversity, equity, and inclusion are fundamental obligations that strengthen our team. We employ a diverse, multi-disciplinary team to build a meaningful company and culture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are not offering new sponsorships opportunities at this time for persons requiring employment visas;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;authorization to work in the UK is a precondition of employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Any unsolicited resumes/candidate profiles submitted through our website or to personal email accounts of employees of LTK are considered the property of LTK and are not subject to payment of agency fees&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;LTK is an Equal Opportunity Employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
